<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '40px 64px 24px 64px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 78, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 30, background: '#C8102E', marginTop: 4 }} />
        <Box style={{ marginLeft: 14, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#C8102E', fontWeight: 700, letterSpacing: 2 }}>10　财务端 · 小程序</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#111827', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.2, marginTop: 6 }}>审批和付钱，在手机上就办完了</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 30, paddingTop: 2 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 280, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#374151', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
                财务最烦的是"凑齐"——单子、票、签字跑三个地方。现在<Text style={{ fontWeight: 700 }}>该审的、该付的、付过的</Text>都在一个手机里。
            </Text>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14, marginTop: 20 }}>
                {[
                    ['待办', '今天几笔要审、几笔要付，一进来就看到'],
                    ['审批', '金额、凭证、上报人同屏，点通过或驳回'],
                    ['台账', '已审、已付、已驳回分册，随时能查'],
                    ['统计', '本月花了多少，按类型排个序']
                ].map((it, i) => (
                    <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10 }}>
                        <Box style={{ width: 2, background: '#C8102E', marginTop: 2 }} />
                        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 252 }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#111827', fontWeight: 700 }}>{it[0]}</Text>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 11.5, color: '#6B7280', lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 3 }}>{it[1]}</Text>
                        </Box>
                    </Box>
                ))}
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />
            <Box style={{ background: '#111827', borderRadius: 4, padding: '14px 16px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 11.5, color: '#C8102E', fontWeight: 800, letterSpacing: 1 }}>以 前 与 现 在</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E5E7EB', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 7 }}>
                    以前月底才对一次账，<br />现在钱走到哪一步，随时都看得到。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 22, justifyContent: 'flex-start' }}>
            {[['assets/mp_todo.png', '待办：该我处理的都在最上面'], ['assets/mp_approve.png', '审批：金额、凭证、上报人一屏看清'], ['assets/mp_stat.png', '统计：本月花了多少、花在哪']].map((it, i) => (
                <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 262 }}>
                    <Image src={it[0]} style={{ width: 262, height: 506 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#9AA3AF', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 10, width: 256 }}>{it[1]}</Text>
                </Box>
            ))}
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 24, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#9AA3AF' }}>车队一体化运营平台</Text>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#9AA3AF' }}>11 / 14</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
